  "steps": [
    "To a pan on medium heat, add 2 tbsp mustard oil, 1 tsp cumin seeds, 1 whole onion, chopped into cubes, 2 slit green chillies, 1 tbsp ginger garlic paste.",
    "Let it cook for around 3 minutes, or until the onions start to brown.",
    "Now add: 1 tsp salt, ½ tsp turmeric, 1 tbsp Kashmiri red chilli powder, 1 tsp coriander powder.",
    "Mix everything well.",
    "Next, add 180g low-fat paneer blended with 150ml water.",
    "Add 1 tsp amchur powder, 1 tsp kasuri methi, 1 handful fresh coriander.",
    "Give it a final mix and let it cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "And it’s ready to serve!"
